OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry with
OL,6,Fsome clear spells initially, although
OL,7,Fcloud and rain are expected to push
OL,8,Fnorth through the early hours. Low
OL,9,Fcloud and fog likely over higher
OL,10,Fground.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FA cloudy and often wet day
OL,13,Facross much of the region with
OL,14,Foutbreaks of rain, heavy at times.
OL,15,FFeeling rather chilly despite light
OL,16,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
