OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FWet
OL,6,Fand windy on Wednesday, before sunny
OL,7,Fspells develop into Thursday with
OL,8,Flighter winds. Then heavy rain will
OL,9,Fspread northeastwards into Friday with
OL,10,Fstrong winds likely.
